For DeepSeek, the effect size increases monotonically from small ($d{=}0.44$) at $s{=}0.15$ to large ($d{=}0.80$) at $s{=}0.30$, with all CIs excluding zero (Table~\ref{tab:cohens-d}). % exp_id: cohens_d_bf16.json
